WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.370
Lesson eleven. Action Time!

2
00:00:04.294 --> 00:00:11.510
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.502 --> 00:00:14.366
Coco, let's play outside!

4
00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:18.258
Yes! It's action time! Let's move!

5
00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:23.195
Run! Say it with me. Run!

6
00:00:27.118 --> 00:00:30.318
Jump! Say it with me. Jump!

7
00:00:34.432 --> 00:00:37.532
Walk! Say it with me. Walk!

8
00:00:41.431 --> 00:00:44.731
Stop! Say it with me. Stop!

9
00:00:48.731 --> 00:00:52.081
Clap! Say it with me. Clap!

10
00:00:56.136 --> 00:00:59.702
Dance! Say it with me. Dance!

11
00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:04.735
I can run!

12
00:01:04.785 --> 00:01:11.598
I can jump! What can you do?

13
00:01:11.648 --> 00:01:12.798
Great!

14
00:01:13.574 --> 00:01:17.391
Run, run, run!

15
00:01:17.441 --> 00:01:20.396
Stop!

16
00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:24.662
Jump, jump, jump!

17
00:01:24.712 --> 00:01:26.681
Stop!

18
00:01:26.731 --> 00:01:28.180
Well done!

19
00:01:29.099 --> 00:01:35.132
This is K. K is for kite. Kite! K is for king. King!

20
00:01:39.157 --> 00:01:46.565
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

21
00:01:46.615 --> 00:01:48.284
Bye-bye, friends!

